":[{"title":"Dark Runed Crown","wikiPath":"/Shadowknight_Thurgadin_Armor_Quests","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Thurgadin","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Dalgrim Underbelly","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Corroded Plate Helmet","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Corroded_Plate_Helmet"},{"name":"Crushed Coral","qty":3,"wikiPath":"/Crushed_Coral"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Dark Runed Crown","item":"Dark Runed Crown","wikiPath":"/Dark_Runed_Crown"}]},{"title":"Dark Runed Breastplate","wikiPath":"/Shadowknight_Thurgadin_Armor_Quests","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Thurgadin","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Dalgrim Underbelly","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Corroded Breastplate","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Corroded_Breastplate"},{"name":"Flawless Diamond","qty":3,"wikiPath":"/Flawless_Diamond"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Dark Runed Breastplate","item":"Dark Runed Breastplate","wikiPath":"/Dark_Runed_Breastplate"}]},{"title":"Dark Runed Vambraces","wikiPath":"/Shadowknight_Thurgadin_Armor_Quests","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Thurgadin","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Dalgrim Underbelly","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Corroded Plate Vambraces","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Corroded_Plate_Vambraces"},{"name":"Flawed Emerald","qty":3,"wikiPath":"/Flawed_Emerald"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Dark Runed Vambraces","item":"Dark Runed Vambraces","wikiPath":"/Dark_Runed_Vambraces"}]},{"title":"Dark Runed Bracer","wikiPath":"/Shadowknight_Thurgadin_Armor_Quests","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Thurgadin","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Dalgrim Underbelly","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Corroded Plate Bracer","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Corroded_Plate_Bracer"},{"name":"Crushed Flame Emerald","qty":3,"wikiPath":"/Crushed_Flame_Emerald"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Dark Runed Bracer","item":"Dark Runed Bracer","wikiPath":"/Dark_Runed_Bracer"}]},{"title":"Dark Runed Gauntlets","wikiPath":"/Shadowknight_Thurgadin_Armor_Quests","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Thurgadin","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Dalgrim Underbelly","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Corroded Plate Gauntlets","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Corroded_Plate_Gauntlets"},{"name":"Crushed Topaz","qty":3,"wikiPath":"/Crushed_Topaz"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Dark Runed Gauntlets","item":"Dark Runed Gauntlets","wikiPath":"/Dark_Runed_Gauntlets"}]},{"title":"Dark Runed Greaves","wikiPath":"/Shadowknight_Thurgadin_Armor_Quests","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Thurgadin","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Dalgrim Underbelly","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Corroded Plate Greaves","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Corroded_Plate_Greaves"},{"name":"Flawed Sea Sapphire","qty":3,"wikiPath":"/Flawed_Sea_Sapphire"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Dark Runed Greaves","item":"Dark Runed Greaves","wikiPath":"/Dark_Runed_Greaves"}]},{"title":"Dark Runed Boots","wikiPath":"/Shadowknight_Thurgadin_Armor_Quests","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Thurgadin","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Dalgrim Underbelly","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Corroded Plate Boots","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Corroded_Plate_Boots"},{"name":"Crushed Black Marble","qty":3,"wikiPath":"/Crushed_Black_Marble"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Dark Runed Boots","item":"Dark Runed Boots","wikiPath":"/Dark_Runed_Boots"}]}],"card":{"title":"Shadowknight Thurgadin Armor Quests","lines":["Minimum Level: 45","Classes: Shadow Knight","Related Zones: Kael Drakkel","Related NPCs: Various (Giants)"]},"links":["Thurgadin","Dalgrim Underbelly","Shadow Knight","Kael Drakkel","Dark Runed Crown","Dark Runed Breastplate","Invigorate","Dark Runed Vambraces","Dark Runed Bracer","Dark Runed Gauntlets","Dark Runed Greaves","Dark Runed Boots","Corroded Plate Helmet","Crushed Coral","Corroded Breastplate","Flawless Diamond","Corroded Plate Vambraces","Flawed Emerald","Corroded Plate Bracer","Crushed Flame Emerald","Corroded Plate Gauntlets","Crushed Topaz","Corroded Plate Greaves","Flawed Sea Sapphire","Corroded Plate Boots","Crushed Black Marble","Coldain","Dain Frostreaver IV","Kromzek","Kromrif"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Dalgrim Underbelly","text":"I wasn't always just a merchant, ye know, I used to work at the temple and spent most of my time in the study of ancient texts and arts. I actually learned a lot about the dark arts in those days. Ye know. . . necromancy. Oh, I'd never touch the stuff, mind ye, but I'll bet I could make a fine set of plate fer shadowknights if'n I had the right materials."},{"npc":"Dalgrim Underbelly","text":"Glad to see ye're interested, ______. The materials would vary by the piece of armor o' course. I could probably forge a fine set of bracers, gauntlets, greaves, boots, armplates, a helm, or a breastplate."},{"npc":"Dalgrim Underbelly","text":"To create a piece of armor to protect your skull I will require three pieces of Crushed Coral as well as a Corroded Plate Helmet."},{"npc":"Dalgrim Underbelly","text":"For the breastplate I will need a Corroded Breastplate and three Flawless Diamonds. Once I have them in my possession it will not take long to craft a sturdy breastplate."},{"npc":"Dalgrim Underbelly","text":"Protection for your arms will come at the price of a set of Corroded Plate Vambraces and three Flawed Emeralds."},{"npc":"Dalgrim Underbelly","text":"For the bracers, I will require a Corroded Plate Bracer and a set of three Crushed Flame Emeralds. Return to me if you happen to find these things in your travels."},{"npc":"Dalgrim Underbelly","text":"Protecting your hands is very important. I can forge protection for your hands if you bring me a pair of Corroded Plate Gauntlets and three Crushed Topaz."},{"npc":"Dalgrim Underbelly","text":"A set of Corroded Plate Greaves might be salvageable if you were to find three Flawed Sea Sapphires. With the right techniques almost anything is possible."},{"npc":"Dalgrim Underbelly","text":"Boots made for battle are not always the most comfortable available. However if you seek a fine set for battle bring me a set of Corroded Plate Boots and three pieces of Crushed Black Marble."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T05:57:03.075Z","outOfEra":true}
