Bozinite Pestle Quest	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Bozinite Pestle Quest","wikiPath":"/Bozinite_Pestle_Quest","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Ak'Anon","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Larkon Theardor","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[],"card":{"title":"Bozinite Pestle Quest","lines":["Minimum Level: 10","Classes: Bard, Cleric, Druid, Enchanter, Magician, Monk, Necromancer, Paladin, Shadowknight, Shaman, Warrior, Wizard","Races: Barbarian, Dwarf, Halfling, High Elf, Wood Elf, Dark Elf, aOgre, Troll, Erudite, [Gnome]], Half-Elf, Human","Related Zones: North Kaladim","Faction: Eldritch Collective positive, Gem Choppers positive, King Ak'Anon positive, Dark Reflection negative, The Dead negative"]},"links":["Ak'Anon","Larkon Theardor","Bard","Cleric","Druid","Enchanter","Magician","Monk","Necromancer","Paladin","Shadowknight","Shaman","Warrior","Wizard","Barbarian","Dwarf","Halfling","High Elf","Wood Elf","Dark Elf","Ogre","Troll","Erudite","Half-Elf","Human","North Kaladim","Myre","Cleaner VII","Giant Rat","Infected Rat","Bozinite Pestle","Eldritch Collective","Gem Choppers","King Ak'Anon","Dark Reflection","The Dead","Minotaur Horns","Scrap metal"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Larkon Theardor","text":"We need someone to venture to the dwarven kingdom of Kaladim and speak with Myre of Miner's Guild 628. She has a delivery of special pestles made from bozinite. If you feel up to it, go to her and tell her you are from the Eldritch Collective and desire the bozinite pestles. Return them to me."},{"npc":"Myre","text":"I am not here to chitchat dear. If you need some gear, I can help. If you want to talk, go find a tavern."},{"npc":"Myre","text":"So you came to get the bozinite pestles, eh? Well, dearie, we have no bozinite pestles. We don't have enough bozinite to spare. One of those wondrous clockwork creatures from Ak'Anon has gone and found a home amongst us dwarves. He is sucking up what little bozinite we have mined. You go and find that little bugger and bring me some of the bozinite he slurped up and I will make you one bozinite pestle. Good luck. He is one quick hunk of metal."},{"npc":"Larkon Theardor","text":"The Eldritch Collective thanks you. You have done a great service. We need these special bozinite pestles for use with our eldritch mortars. Here is a scroll from our library. Study it and use it wisely."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T05:57:06.364Z","outOfEra":false}
Guild Summons - Dismal Rage Necromancer	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Guild Summons - Dismal Rage Necromancer","wikiPath":"/Guild_Summons_-_Dismal_Rage_Necromancer","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"East Freeport","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"a tattered note","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Dark Stained Robe*","item":"Dark Stained Robe*","wikiPath":"/Dark_Stained_Robe*"}],"card":{"title":"Guild Summons - Dismal Rage Necromancer","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: Necromancer","Related Zones: East Freeport","Related NPCs: Opal Darkbriar"]},"links":["Guild Summons","East Freeport","A tattered note","Necromancer","Opal Darkbriar","Dark Stained Robe*","Opal Dark Briar","Dismal Rage","The Dead","Bloodsabers"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Opal Darkbriar","text":"Greetings! You will have to excuse me. I have no time to talk right now and I prefer to be left alone. Please leave."},{"npc":"Opal Darkbriar","text":"Welcome to the Guild, here's your guild robe. Now, let's get to work."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T05:57:07.461Z","outOfEra":false}
Preserved Meat Delivery	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Preserved Meat Delivery","wikiPath":"/Preserved_Meat_Delivery","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Oggok","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Chef Dooga","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Ogre Butcher Gloves","item":"Ogre Butcher Gloves","wikiPath":"/Ogre_Butcher_Gloves"},{"text":"Ogre Meat Cleaver","item":"Ogre Meat Cleaver","wikiPath":"/Ogre_Meat_Cleaver"},{"text":"Star Rose Quartz","item":"Star Rose Quartz","wikiPath":"/Star_Rose_Quartz"}],"card":{"title":"Preserved Meat Delivery","lines":["Minimum Level: 4","Classes: All","Related Zones: Neriak Foreign Quarter","Related NPCs: The Gobbler"]},"links":["Oggok","Chef Dooga","Neriak","The Gobbler","Ogre Butcher Gloves","Ogre Meat Cleaver","Star Rose Quartz","HEHE Meat Quest","Preserved Leg","Neriak Ogre"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Chef Dooga","text":"Welcome you, _____. You look all skin 'n bones. Eat you must do. Chef Dooga can fix up goodies for you. Try [HEHE meat]."},{"npc":"Chef Dooga","text":"It is a secret ground meat made with high elf, human, and Erudite Flesh. Mmmm. It good stuff. Dooga make it and [the Gobbler] make it. If you find any of those meats in the swamps bring to me and I pay you."},{"npc":"Chef Dooga","text":"You no hear of the Gobbler!! Him great butcher. Have all kinds of meat. Him am low on froglok legs. Dooga supply him. Dooga need someone to [deliver froglok legs]."},{"npc":"Chef Dooga","text":"You think so!! That be good thing. Make the Gobbler happy. Maybe he give you something good. Maybe not. you take this. Deliver meat."},{"npc":"The Gobbler","text":"Meat! You need meat. Me gots meat! High elf meat, dwarf meat, human meat, [HEHE meat], [froggy legs]. Me got a lot."},{"npc":"The Gobbler","text":"HEHE meat? It human, Erudite 'n high elf, mashed together. Mmmm. Very tasty!"},{"npc":"The Gobbler","text":"Froggy legs come from far away. Me get from friend, [Chef Dooga]. It not tasty. Trolls like it. Eat it up much. They eat too much froggy. Me glad [Nerbilik] leave Neriak! He eat way too much froggy."},{"npc":"The Gobbler","text":"Friend in Oggok is Chef Dooga. Chef she is. Used to work in Neriak. She beautiful. She supply the Gobbler with [froglok legs]. They very low now. Fat trolls eat too many! Me need to [pick up froglok legs]."},{"npc":"The Gobbler","text":"Uggh! Froglok legs! Me hate smelly legs, but me need it for fat trolls."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T05:57:08.548Z","outOfEra":false}
Guild Summons - Gate Callers	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Guild Summons - Gate Callers","wikiPath":"/Guild_Summons_-_Gate_Callers","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Erudin Palace","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Markus Jaevins","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Old Torn Robe*","item":"Old Torn Robe*","wikiPath":"/Old_Torn_Robe*"}],"card":{"title":"Guild Summons - Gate Callers","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: Magician","Related Zones: Erudin Palace","Related NPCs: Markus Jaevins"]},"links":["Guild Summons","Erudin Palace","Markus Jaevins","Magician","Old Torn Robe*","A tattered note","Craftkeepers","High Council of Erudin","Heretics","High Guard of Erudin"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Markus Jaevins","text":"Greetings, young one! It is always good to see a new face here in the Palace of Erudin, the perfect city-state, free from [crime]."},{"npc":"Markus Jaevins","text":"Welcome. young one! I see you show interest in the circle of magic. Nowhere upon Norrath will you find a greater school than this - the Gatecallers. You shall wear this robe as a sign that you have begun the training of this circle. Remember. the power of the Gatecaller is the power of summoning. Good luck, friend!"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T05:57:09.640Z","outOfEra":false}
