Call of Flame Quest	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Call of Flame Quest","wikiPath":"/Call_of_Flame_Quest","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Greater Faydark","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Lily Ashwood","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Poacher's Head","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Poacher%27s_Head"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Spell: Call of Flame","item":"Call of Flame","wikiPath":"/Call_of_Flame"}],"card":{"title":"Call of Flame Quest","lines":["Minimum Level: 50+","Classes: Ranger","Related Zones: Mistmoore, East Karana, Kithicor Forest, Lower Guk, Nagafen's Lair","Related NPCs: Aanina Rockfinder, Devin Ashwood, Ganelorn Oast, Kithicor, Vance Bearstalker, a reanimated hand, imp protector"]},"links":["Greater Faydark","Lily Ashwood","Ranger","Mistmoore","East Karana","Kithicor Forest","Lower Guk","Nagafen's Lair","Aanina Rockfinder","Devin Ashwood","Ganelorn Oast","Kithicor","Vance Bearstalker","A reanimated hand (Lower Guk)","Imp protector","Call of Flame","Love Letter (Sealed)","Albino Rattlesnake Eggs","Symbol of Achievement","Note of Credit","North Kaladim","Gift","Burnt Sash","Adamantite Band","Electrum-Bladed Wakizashi","Vampire Teeth","Faydarks Champions","King Tearis Thex","Clerics of Tunare","Soldiers of Tunare","Crushbone Orcs","Kithicor Residents","Protectors of Pine","Jaggedpine Treefolk","Unkempt Druids","Kaladim","Karana Bandits","Karana Residents","Guards of Qeynos","Highpass Guards","Circle Of Unseen Hands","Poacher's Head"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Devin Ashwood","text":"Good day to you, _____! I am Devin Ashwood. Pleased to make your acquaintance."},{"npc":"Lily Ashwood","text":"I sure love a strong ranger. Especially Ganelorn Oast. He's so dreamy and handsome. I think one day he's going to ask me to marry him."},{"npc":"Devin Ashwood","text":"Bah! Why would the greatest forester in all of Norrath ask you to marry him? Between his time spent protecting wildlife, hunting poachers and training me, I doubt he has any spare time for a foolish girl like you, sister."},{"npc":"Devin Ashwood","text":"Ganelorn Oast! For he has single-handedly caught more poachers than any other ranger. He is credited for helping numerous endangered species recover from certain extinction. I suppose I am lucky he is fond of my sister, as I am soon to train under him as an apprentice. Perhaps one day I will even [call upon the flames] in the way that he does."},{"npc":"Devin Ashwood","text":"Aye, Ganelorn is renowned not only for his abilities as an archer and a master of melee combat, but also for his use of powerful magics. Never before have I seen a forester evoke a fireball of such great force. It would be any ranger's dream to become his pupil just to study that one spell. Ganelorn doesn't train just anyone, though. If you want to learn from him, I'm certain you would have to prove yourself as a forester."},{"npc":"Devin Ashwood","text":"He is a very busy individual. I believe he is currently in the eastern part of the Karanas trying to track down a poacher. Even if you can track him down, don't get your hopes up."},{"npc":"Ganelorn Oast","text":"Please be very quiet. I am tracking a notorious poacher."},{"npc":"Ganelorn Oast","text":"I suppose you would like to call the flame? I must know you are a dedicated forester before I would even consider teaching such a thing."},{"npc":"Ganelorn Oast","text":"Ah, what do we have here? A letter? Hmm? Scented with a familiar fragrance too. You must have gotten this from Lily. I do wish I had more time to spend with her, for she is a very sweet girl. If she trusts you to deliver such a letter, I must ask you to do me a favor for me. Please take these eggs. They are a very rare species of albino rattlesnakes which were thought to have been extinct due to poachers who eat them as a delicacy and griffins which prey on them. If these eggs hatch there is hope for the species. I need you to deliver them to my master, Kithicor."},{"npc":"Kithicor","text":"Wow, this is certainly something I have not seen in a long time. It was said that this species of snake had been wiped out due to the poachers and griffins. It was very noble of you to help in saving this species. I will see that these are raised properly. Please wear this icon with pride so other rangers will know of the good deed you have done."},{"npc":"Ganelorn Oast","text":"This does speak highly of you, my friend, an award from Kithicor does not come easy. But I must see more of your skills before I can consider teaching you. Lily's brother Devin is my current pupil - I need you to gather some equipment for me so I can properly train him. I require the following items of you - a smoldering sash, an adamantine ring and a blade forged of electrum. I also need a favor. Take this credit slip to Aanina Rockfinder. She is a merchant from whom I purchased a gift for Lily; it should be ready by now."},{"npc":"Aanina Rockfinder","text":"Ah, nice of you to come and pick this up for Ganelorn! I know he is a busy fellow. I certainly hope that his girlfriend will like this gift."},{"npc":"Vance Bearstalker","text":"Ha! You are not going to be able to stop me from poaching!"},{"npc":"Ganelorn Oast","text":"You, _____, are a worthy forester. It brings me great pride to present you this scroll that I have only passed to the finest in all of Norrath. Now you, too, may call the flames."},{"npc":"Lily Ashwood","text":"Oh! If you're going to see him, would you please take this letter to him? I trust you, since you're a ranger and all."},{"npc":"Ganelorn Oast","text":"You have done well. I sense the one I have been hunting in the distance. As your final test, you must track him down and destroy him."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T07:26:32.091Z","outOfEra":false}
The Fisherman	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"The Fisherman","wikiPath":"/The_Fisherman","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Paineel","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Antus Shelbra","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Aglthin's Fishing Pole","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Aglthin%27s_Fishing_Pole"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Staff of the Abattoir Initiate","item":"Staff of the Abattoir Initiate","wikiPath":"/Staff_of_the_Abattoir_Initiate"},{"text":"Experience, Faction, Coin"}],"card":{"title":"The Fisherman","lines":["Minimum Level: 8","Classes: Necromancer","Related Zones: Toxxulia Forest","Related NPCs: Aglthin Dasmore"]},"links":["Paineel","Antus Shelbra","Necromancer","Toxxulia Forest","Aglthin Dasmore","Staff of the Abattoir Initiate","Heretics","Deepwater Knights","Gate Callers","Craftkeepers","Crimson Hands","Aglthin's Fishing Pole"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Antus Shelbra","text":"Greetings, _______. You have come to me searching for tasks and tasks I have. Would you judge yourself an [experienced heretic] or one who has [much to learn]?"},{"npc":"Antus Shelbra","text":"Very well, ____. I do have a task for you. There is an old and frail Erudite male that now lives in Toxxulia named Aglthin Dasmore. He has left the ways of Cazic-Thule and no longer practices our craft. He has been stripped of his power and wealth, so he spends his time fishing by the river. Our great Lord of Fear has decreed that his life is forfeit. Slay him, and bring me proof of the deed."},{"npc":"Aglthin Dasmore","text":"I am so tired. Leave me be. All I wish to do is fish! Can't I have even a few seconds alone?!"},{"npc":"Antus Shelbra","text":"Excellent, _______. You have proven yourself to be a true follower of Cazic-Thule. Continue on the path you have chosen, and you will surely become one of the mightiest in the land."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T07:26:33.183Z","outOfEra":false}
